# Trading 212 API credentials
#
# Create a key from the T212 MOBILE APP: Settings → API (Beta) → Generate new key
# Tick at least: View portfolio, Account data
# Optional for later: History (dividends + executed orders)
#
# IMPORTANT: T212's auth scheme is HTTP Basic, NOT raw key as most SDKs assume.
# You need BOTH of these from the app:
#   - API Key ID   (labelled "API Key ID" in the app, starts with your account number)
#   - Secret Key   (the long alphanumeric secret, shown once at generation)
# The sync script base64-encodes "API_KEY_ID:SECRET" and sends as "Authorization: Basic ...".
#
# Rename this file to t212.env and fill in the values below.
# Use "live" host for real money / ISA, "demo" for practice mode.

T212_API_KEY_ID=paste_your_api_key_id_here
T212_API_KEY=paste_your_secret_key_here
T212_AUTH_MODE=basic
T212_HOST=https://live.trading212.com
